<h3>Production and Technical Personnel</h3>

<p>Produced by <strong>Nicky Ryan</strong>.</p>

<p>Co-produced by <strong>Enya</strong> and <strong>Ross Cullum</strong>.</p>

<p>Executive producer: <strong>Rob Dickins</strong>.</p>

<p>Engineered and mixed by <strong>Ross Cullum</strong> at Wessex Sound Studios, except <a href="#Orinoco_Flow">"Orinoco Flow"</a> mixed by <strong>Jimbo Barton</strong>, and <a href="/enya-other/#Storms_In_Africa_Part_II">"Storms in Africa II"</a> mixed by <strong>Pete Schwier</strong>.</p>

<h3>Artwork and Recording Studios</h3>

<p>Cover photography by <strong>David Hiscock</strong> with additional photography by <strong>Russel Yamy</strong>.</p>

<p>Graphic design by <strong>Lawrence Dunmore</strong>.</p>

